<div class="card table-wrap"><div class="card-head"><h3><?=e($labels[$view])?></h3><a class="btn ghost" href="?page=nonsellable&stock_view=<?=e($view)?><?= $history?'':'&history=all'?>"><?=$history?'Active / Recent':'View all history'?></a></div><p class="muted small">Remaining is the original entry minus explicitly linked releases and reclassifications. Legacy unlinked releases require review against the product’s total restricted balance.</p>
